    "final": "The lowest price for a purchasable size XS Wexcombe tee is $12.61, charged by Dovercourt Apparel (Wexcombe Midweight Jersey Tee, Short Sleeve - Dovercourt Apparel, http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-09.html). I opened all 45 tee listings in the search results (36 on page 1 + 9 on page 2; every result was a Wexcombe tee, so none were excluded as non-tees). On each I checked the XS option: 28 listings sell an XS that can actually be bought (option not disabled, stock in, Add to Cart enabled); 17 listings were excluded because XS was disabled/out of stock (e.g., Whitlock $11.51, Chandler $23.17, Fenwick $23.72, Oakhurst $35.40) or not offered at all (Brockwell, Bramley, Carnforth, Lymington, Everleigh, Copperfield, Garrick, Crowhurst, Ambleside, etc.). Note that several listings label XS with a 'Promo $X' teaser (e.g., Kettering 'Promo $11.34', Marchmont 'Promo $10.91', Grantley 'Promo $25.74'); I verified via add-to-cart that those labels are not the charged price \u2014 the actual charged price is the real final price (Kettering $14.25, Marchmont $14.54, Grantley $29.61). Verified on the Dovercourt page itself: selecting XS shows $12.61, stock 'In stock', Add to Cart enabled.",
